Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, done with another\Ngrueling day of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all I want to do is go home and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Koichi, it's… you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Hazamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, hi, what's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about all the trouble\NI gave you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, have you completely\Nrecovered from your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The talk sent me home two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, where's Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably already went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe it, but he\Nfound an invisible baby yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now they're bending over\Nbackwards to find its mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the baby is a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the baby has formed\Na bond with Josuke's dad, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, if Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar isn't nearby at all times, she\Nturns everything around her invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this mean this Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:01:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar is gonna stick\Naround Morioh for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.08,0:01:10.59,Note,Hazamada,0,0,0,,Note: Manga is the Japanese equivalent of comics.\N Mangakas are comic book authors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, do you happen\Nto like manga? Manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess I like him\Nas much as the next guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of Rohan Kishibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He draws Pink Dark Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the biggest Pink\NDark Boy fans in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.19,0:01:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking about the suspense\Nhorror series, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never get it mixed\Nup with anything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can get pretty gross sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's worth it for the horror\Naesthetic and complex characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, here's a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe actually\Nlives right here in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear you right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lives here in Morioh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost too good to\Nbe true, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I couldn't believe it either!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard some realtors talking about\Nit while I was at the comic store.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mind-boggling news,\Nbut it's absolutely true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some autographs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:02:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really get each\Nother, huh? You think so?
