Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.55,0:02:03.06,Episode 14 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(991.314,696.486)}Kishibe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that might be his studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.70,0:02:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder if Rohan has any family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, he lives alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made his debut four years\Nago, back when he was 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only 20 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he was about\Nmy age when he went pro.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.08,0:02:29.58,Episode 14 Typesetting 3back,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\an7\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&H50C5D6&}m 67 672 l 146 659 256 681 273 708 279 791 268 817 213 831 75 808 49 783
