Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.08,0:02:29.58,Episode 14 Typesetting 3,Hazamada,0,0,0,,{\frz355\pos(164.7,779.6)}Kishibe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snooping around out here\Nwon't do us any good, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to ring the doorbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why do I have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have seniority over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to be honest, this kind\Nof stuff makes me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not fair at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.66,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 14: {\fs80} Let's Go Visit the Mangaka's House, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.66,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 14: {\fs80} Let's Go Visit the Comics Artist's House Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Rohan Kishibe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks just like his picture\Non the cover of that special
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Year's edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Mr. Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who, pray tell, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of prank? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd never do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're students from\NBurugahoka High School!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're fans of yours,\NSensei! Fans? Of me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My address must have gotten leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just happened to hear it in passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's not too much trouble, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan, but could we have\Na couple of autographs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd really make our day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're fans, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might just be on the same wavelength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pleasure to sign autographs\Nfor two of my biggest fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad we came?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you like a little\Nstudio tour while you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd really let us see\Nwhere the magic happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already finished today's work,\Nbut if you're still interested then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.72,0:04:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those are four color originals!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even more powerful in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the most magical day ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I have to know, sensei, how long\Nhave you been working at a Morioh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been living here\Nfor about three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family lives in S-City,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when I was a child, we\Nactually called Mariah our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokyo has its perks, but it's too chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has none of Morio's serenity and\Nisn't at all conducive to creativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today's fax machines and photocopiers\Nare more advanced than they've ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can send a complete\Nmanuscript in four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No point living in the city now, unless\Nyou care about status and all that drivel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what about your\Nassistants and staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do they factor in? They don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I work alone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get 19 pages of complex\Ndrawings done in a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four days, actually. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five if they're in color.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On off days, I amuse myself\Nwith travel and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not much of a people person, which\Nis why I chose to be a manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assistant would only be\Nan unnecessary hindrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a total genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a spider!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suburbia never ceases to amaze\Nwith its bugs and spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr. Rohan? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Arrhenius ventricosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It inhabits homes and\Nrural areas across Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an orb-weaving spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a number of them\Nweave webs day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you know what it takes to create\Ncaptivating stories for manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reality, reality is the driving force\Nthat makes a drawing come totally alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its entertainment on the\Nhighest possible level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People assume manga is born\Nof imagination and fantasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they couldn't be more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great manga is one that\Ncaptures things experienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seen and felt by flesh and blood beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this exquisite spider for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something a typical city\Ndweller would kill in disgust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way the legs connect to the body\Nand the positions of its many eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even subtle differences\Nbetween the male and female.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A manga artist must understand each\Nof these elements to draw a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said a spider's silk\Nsolidifies when exposed to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But have you ever given any\Nthought to its spinnerets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:07:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's the intricate\Narrangement of its internal organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does a spider squirm,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when it's been sliced\Nopen and awaiting certain death?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To depict reality in detail,\None must know such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's barbaric! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare an amateur like you\Ngive Rohan Kishibe his opinion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't voicing my\Nopinion at all! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, the stereotype is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manga artists really are total weirdos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An excellent expression of agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your vomiting reflex is so raw,\NI simply must sketch it. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you're just pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's forget about the sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted autographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see if I can find\Na pen in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring some tea out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan is great! What a process!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know what makes\NPink Dark Boy so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His need to know every single\Ndetail is on another level!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Azamara?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we just got here and all, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, don't you think it's\Nabout time for us to get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't really say why I'm\Nso nervous all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gut has been known to\Nbe wrong on rare occasions,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but right now it's telling me that there's\Nsomething really dangerous about Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's a stan user?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a weird feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan is what those hippie artist\Ntypes would call avant-garde,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean\Nyou should immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jump to conclusions about\Nhim being a stan user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you, I\Ndon't think he is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have a bad feeling, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Let's say Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan actually is a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be amazing for us, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.06,0:09:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awesome would it be to have something\Nin common with a famous manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I feel you. So let's leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If something about him's giving\Nyou the willies, then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can always come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing caught my eye, so\NI have to check it out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thing? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Koichi, you're so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, it's on top of the\Ndesk next to the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better believe it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he just finished\Nworking on it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had my eye on it since we came\Nin here, and it's the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never dreamed this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A freshly drawn manuscript\Nfor Pink Dark Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, does this mean\Nno one else has seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go home right after\NI get a glimpse of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get Rohan's permission first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't know anything\Nabout manga artists, do you, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of these pre-printed manuscripts are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,highly confidential in\Nevery sense of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd let a couple\Nof outsiders like us look at
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a manuscript before the editors\Neven had a chance to give notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take a peek, then put it right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a horrible idea. Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not hurting anyone by reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a thrilling manga, but\Nseeing an abusive person like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is giving me major\Ngoosebumps all over my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and turn the page, Hazamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to know what comes next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears my manuscript's\Ncompatible with you two after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How auspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a hunch you might read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you are compatible\Nfirst-time readers of my new manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I'm not I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will now experience my\Nglorious ability, Heaven's Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a gateway to your very souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does my hand feel weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, what the hell is happening to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.42,Episode 14 Typesetting 1back,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(1121.714,63.142)\be0.3}m 0 0 l 800 0 800 1000 0 1000{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.42,Episode 14 Typesetting 1a,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,170)}Morioh Landmark #5:
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.42,Episode 14 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,330)}Comics Artist Kishibe \NRohan's House
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.42,Episode 14 Typesetting 1c,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,590)}Location: One minute's walk \Nfrom the Kotodai 2nd Street\N bus stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.42,0:11:35.42,Episode 14 Typesetting 1d,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1131,880)}Grounds: A mansion with an attic \Nsituated on 340 square meters of land. \NAttempting to visit is futile since \NRohan will pretend to be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many things are recorded in the human\Nbody over the course of one's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single thing from\Nthe moment you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To peruse your records I shall\Ntransform you both into books.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnificent books that\Nchronicle your life's stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody else!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you read my manga as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:11:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ability won't physically harm\Nyou, so there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Neven want from us anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In manga, the creator's sense of\Nreality is critical, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, I will read all about your\Nlives and experiences thus far,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and these pages will fill my\Nconsciousness with realistic ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More effective than an interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will tell me everything you've\Nlived through with 100 % accuracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as if I had been there\Nto experience it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi Hirose, born March\N28, 1984, at 6.27 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were delivered at Red\NCross Hospital in S-City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A preemie of 2,325 grams, you\Nspent a week in an incubator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A family of four and an\Nolder sister named Ayana.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In grade school and middle school,\Nyou led a relatively ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You also happened to be a\Nremarkably genuine soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An admirable quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:12:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you're hiding a secret\Nability, are you? Reverb, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it seems that there\Nare other individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the world with these\Nfantastical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have powers, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand users, huh? Astounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything in here dated after\NApril 1999 is just extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An explosion of wondrous experiences!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata, Jotaro Kujo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako Yamagishi, Okuyasu\NNijimura, Tamami Kobayashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible and utterly captivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In these pages, Koichi Hirose,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just uncovered the\Nmother load of manga material.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond, Star Platinum, The\NHand, Love Deluxe, et Star, et Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you\Nplanning to do to us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it isn't obvious yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use your memories\Nto write my manga. River!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to ask you nicely once\Nto stop attacking us with your stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you persist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike me with reverb act two\Nsound attack? Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't release me from your\Nstand right now, I won't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's actually a section devoted\Nto that written on page 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've always been far more\Ntimid than most others,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and many tend to blatantly disrespect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when push comes to shove, you find\Nthe courage to conquer your fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for my readers, they'll feel\Nthe same once they get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not bluffing, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll attack if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't know\Nwhen to shut up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it if you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb, act two, go!
