Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You honestly missed at that range?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you let it go wide on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to\Nyou, but your aim is shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't miss this time!
