Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of placing\Na little safety lock on Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can attack me to your heart's content,\Nbut you're no longer able to land a blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safety lock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in the margin on page 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I added that new rule as a\Nlittle bit of a safety measure,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just in case you used your stand.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.62,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot bring harm to the mangaka Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.62,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot bring harm to comics artist Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the awesome\Npower of Heaven's Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use words and\Npictures to read people's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,experiences or create brand new memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what sort of\Ntricks you have up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to do me\Nharm as long as I have this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chin up, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all the tampering I intend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I meddled with your pages any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your precious life would\Nlose all authenticity?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'd no longer be of\Nany benefit to my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's have a look\Nat your pages, Hazamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a genius in every\Nsense of the word, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I respect you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll see about that. Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sometimes find a sense of comfort\Nin picking on creatures weaker than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like helpless kittens and small birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to have your way with\NJunko, a junior from Class E,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but are too cowardly to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your testicles often grow sweaty, and\Nwhen you adjust them during class,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing thrills you more than the thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that someone might see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a disgusting troll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Including someone like you in my\Nmanga would drive readers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need any of my\Nexperiences to create stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a spectacular manga\Nartist all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every reader in the world knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you're only 20 years old\Nand live in this amazing house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of how blessed you are\Ncompared with most people your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do you need my memories\Nwhen you're already grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that I, Rohan Kishibe, draw\Nmanga to gather money and admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I draw manga so that people\Naround the world will read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only objective is for\Npeople to read my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a single simple reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, it's all I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People want honesty\Nwhen they read my work,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I search for inspirational\Nrealism every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And truth be told, I absolutely love\Nthe feeling of finishing a manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone feels good after finishing\Na project they've worked hard on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:18:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that gratification is\Nfleeting and immaterial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.28,0:18:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the initial rush\Nof euphoria is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I begin to think no one will\Nread the manga I slaved over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my deep-seated\Ninsecurities begin to flare up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if all my readers\Nare gone by next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I don't know what\Nto draw for the next issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.52,0:18:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I lose the ability to draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if my motivation disappears?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the recurring thoughts\Nthat have tormented me over and over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I was a 16-year-old novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until three months ago when a mysterious\Nstranger shot me to the core with an arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I gained the ability of Heaven's Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Keicho Nichimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw his name written on your pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two have no idea what it's like\Nto find the perfect inspiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your ultimate masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I found it at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I'm taking your reality and\Nusing it as a muse for my new stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Koichi, I told you Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan was a super nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad we decided\Nto pay him a visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely, I had a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did he give us\Nthese great autographs,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was even kind enough to\Nserve us tea and cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go back as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.35,0:19:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today kicked ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still surprised he\Nwas such a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never speak of what\Nhappened, right, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the heck did I lose 20 kilograms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it reads 5 kilograms,\Nso the scale's not broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this must be the work\Nof an enemy stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other way I could\Npossibly lose 20 kilograms this fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who's the user?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to talk to Josuke about the -
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ko, what are you\Ndoing over there? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ntalking about, you weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, he's wandering\Naround the house in his goofy boxers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I was thinking about\Nsomething really important a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I managed to forget so easily,\Nit couldn't have been that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do my shoes and bag feel\Nheavier than usual today? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I ended up walking all\Nthe way back to Rohan's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.76,0:21:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to drop in and thank him for\Nbeing such a great host yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being an artist, he's\Nprobably still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be rude to just barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw that, right, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.65,0:21:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spying feels wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's out of character for Koichi\Nto act so weird and ditch school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I want to know who\Nin the world lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's no way he's\Nmeeting up with some chick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's working with such a chilling\Nexpression and for some reason I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't shake the feeling that being\Nin this house is actually terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you finally made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.36,0:22:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on time for our session.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.26,0:22:52.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.89,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.89,0:22:57.68,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.35,0:23:01.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.73,0:23:04.11,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.11,0:23:06.90,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.90,0:23:08.61,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.61,0:23:10.86,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.86,0:23:13.20,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.20,0:23:14.83,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.83,0:23:17.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.45,0:23:21.96,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.96,0:23:25.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.50,0:23:30.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.97,0:23:34.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
